# ============================================================
#  Explosion-Particle Presets — LemonCosmetics
#
#  25 built-in presets ship with the plugin. Define EXTRA presets
#  here — no recompiling needed. Reloaded on plugin restart.
#
#  Fields per preset:
#    name      - display name shown in the GUI
#    price     - cost in coins (underscores allowed: 1_000)
#    particle  - a Bukkit Particle enum name (e.g. FLAME, END_ROD)
#    sound     - a Bukkit Sound enum name (optional)
#    icon      - a Material enum name for the GUI icon (optional)
#
#  Ids must be unique and must not clash with built-in ids.
# ============================================================

# Example (remove the leading # of every line to activate):
#explosion honey_burst
#  name      "Honey Burst"
#  price     650
#  particle  FALLING_HONEY
#  sound     BLOCK_HONEY_BLOCK_SLIDE
#  icon      HONEY_BOTTLE
